    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLIGHT FACTS FROM YOUR CAPTAIN\nTHE CONSTELLATION, built by Lockheed for TWA and holder of coast-to-coast\nrecord of 6 hours, 57 minutes, now serves the armed forces. TWA Color-Photo.",
      "IF YOU PLEASE\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE",
      "The Constellation in Flight\nColor-foto by TWA",
      "\"Stratoliner in Flight\nTWA Color-foto",
      "'Stratoliner in Flight\nTWA Color-foto",
      "951\n878\nTICKET ISSUED BY\nTRANSCONTINENTAL \u0026 WESTERN AIR INC.\nWE ST\n101 WEST ELEVENTH STREET.\nKANSAS\nCITY, MISSOURI, U.S. A.\nMRSR. GERSON\nPASSENGER'S NAME_\nFROM.\nSHAMMON\n_TO-\nNEW YORK\nMEMBER OF INTERNATIONAL AIR TRANSPORT ASSOCIATION (I. A. T.",
      "951\n877\n17-\nTICKET ISSUED BY\nTRANSCONTINENTAL \u0026 WESTERN AIR INC.\n101 WEST ELEVENTH STREET.\nKANSAS CITY, MISSOURI, U.S. A.\nPASSENGER'S NAME_\nSHANNON\nMR H. GERSON\nFROM.\n_TO_\nNEW YORK\nMEMBER OF INTERNATIONAL AIR TRANSPORT ASSOCIATION (I. A. T. A.)",
      "951\n879\nTICKET ISSUED BY\nTRANSCONTINENTAL \u0026 WESTERN AIR INC.\n1O1 WEST ELEVENTH STREET\nKANSAS\nCITY, MISSOURI, U.S. A.\nPASSENGER'S NAME MASTER N. GERSON\nFROM\nSHANNON\n_TO.\nNEN YORK\nMEMBER OF INTERNATIONAL AIR TRANSPORT ASSOCIATION (I. A. T. A.)",
      "WELCOME\nto the order of\nV..?\nTo us you're a \"Very Important Passenger\"\n- a V. I.P. You are flying in a shining new\nConstellation, fastest carrier of the Air\nTransport Command.\nToday it is an airline transport-swift, pow-\nerful, superbly dependable. You are one of\nthe first commercial travelers to actually en-\njoy its pleasures. We want you to know the\nairplane-its contribution to modern air\ntravel - what makes it great! This booklet\nwill make you a well-informed V. I. P.",
      "THE\nWORLD\nIS\nAT\nYOUR\nDOOR",
      "MARCH, 1946\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE\nSPHINX AT CAIRO, EGYPT\nCopyright 1946, Transcontinental \u0026 Western Air, Inc.",
      "TWA\nWA -\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE",
      "TWA\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE\nTWA"
    ],
